msgstr "Geef op hoe lang openbare pagina's worden gecached, in seconden."

#: tpl/cache/settings-ttl.tpl.php:44
msgid "Specify how long, in seconds, private pages are cached."
msgstr "Geef op hoe lang privépagina's worden gecached, in seconden."

